WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Three tasks. Growing experience.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:19.132
Use simulation knowledge to cover red, green, then blue.

00:00:19.132 --> 00:00:33.116
Reuse the covering strategy. Ground the next grasp in the scene.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:48.625
Complete the final cover and verify the task.

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:50.625
Task success verified.

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:54.625
Update knowledge. Carry it forward.

00:00:54.625 --> 00:01:02.436
Retrieve maintained knowledge to read the counts and press in order.

00:01:02.436 --> 00:01:08.804
Complete two separate green press-and-release cycles.

00:01:08.804 --> 00:01:23.125
Press blue once, then confirm with red.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.125
Task success verified.

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:29.125
Update knowledge. Carry it forward.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:38.794
Combine cup manipulation with counting and pressing.

00:01:38.794 --> 00:01:47.302
Retrieve placement knowledge to set the cup aside.

00:01:47.302 --> 00:01:52.050
Count the blocks: red ×2, green ×1, blue ×1.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:57.469
Retrieve Task 2 experience: one press, release, verify, then continue.

00:01:57.469 --> 00:02:02.570
Complete the second distinct red cycle before advancing.

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:13.812
Refine the green target using fresh physical feedback.

00:02:13.812 --> 00:02:23.833
Complete the blue cycle and verify the composed task.

00:02:23.833 --> 00:02:25.833
Task success verified.

00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:30.833
Turn physical experience into reusable knowledge.

